    "title": "Tiktok will reduce employees in American units",
    "text": "Tiktok once again reduced employees in the Tiktok store of the US e -commerce unit. This is the third firm wave in the team since April this year. The company says that changes are related to the need to modify operating processes and focus on long -term strategic purposes. The exact number of abbreviations is not disclosed.\nIn recent months, significant rearrangement has occurred in the Tiktok store in the United States. After this unit did not achieve internal sales goals last year, two abbreviations were passed in April and May. In addition, the company began to replace a part of employees hired in the Seattle area, by managers from China, trying to repeat the success of the parent company Bytedance in the Asian e -commerce segment.",
